## Test tokens

This project interacts with **tUSD8**, a test-only stablecoin on QDay Aevum
Testnet, at `0x456569838f1d43009A91ebA4263147Afd7233483`.

tUSD8 is issued by QDay (a product of PQA Labs) for testing on Aevum
Testnet. It has no value, it is not tradeable on any public exchange, and
nothing in this repository promises or issues it. Any deployment of these
contracts on a public network would require a different token.
